{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act10mini_level_act10mini_st02",
  "groupId": "act10mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "我如浮萍",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act10mini/level_act10mini_st02.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1eb53cfd15bceee3eb50b88a5a78963f4d0d918240b8127282ad108ddad55e98",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1097年11月19日 9:20 P.M."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "走這邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "還在前面，我好像看見她了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "等等，這塊路牌，我們剛才是不是見過？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "我們回到原地了，我是說，又回到原地了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "那我說對了，那個菲林的源石技藝肯定有鬼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "先別急，前面就是感染者社區了，那個小賊肯定就躲在裡面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "該死的感染者......今天就是把這裡掀個底朝天也要把那個賊揪出來，看誰敢攔我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "算了，回去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "頭兒，就這麼放過她，那些錢和東西就不管了......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "算了算了，統共就那麼點東西，這點錢大家湊一湊墊上吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "老爺反覆交代過，絕對不許多生事端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "誰要是給老爺惹了不必要的麻煩，那就不只是開除的事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保安隊長",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "text": "先撤吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "]"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "呵呵~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "想要抓住貓貓的話，得再聰明一點才行哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "小敏，你在嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "女巫姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "給，今天的飯和藥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "謝謝姐姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "好啦，慢點吃，別噎到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一塊乾麵包，一頓充饑的飯。\n我是什麼時候開始施捨他人的呢？\n明明自己的生活已經難以為繼了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "咳......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "姐姐你......臉色好差哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "是嗎......有那麼明顯嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "女巫姐姐，我什麼時候也能像你一樣使用源石技藝啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "現在還不可以哦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "欸......可是我也想變成女巫，像你那樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "等你再長大一點吧，小貓貓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "咳......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "刺痛。\n礦石病病灶的刺痛從三個月前起就再也沒有停止過。\n也許自己也該離開這個地方了。\n結晶粉塵化的時候，誤傷到別人可不好。\n不，對於一隻優雅的貓來說，對於一個巫女林的術師來說——\n離開這個世界的時候，也必須是孤獨而優雅的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "一家、兩家、三家......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "七隻、八隻、九隻......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你猜猜，這片感染者區裡，一共有幾家酒館，幾隻流浪貓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "我數得很清楚喔，一共有八家酒館，三十二隻流浪貓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "每家酒館可以分到四隻貓咪，每隻貓咪都可以分到新鮮的鱗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "有沒有算過，自己已經走過了多少個城市，去過幾個感染者聚集區？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "我記得，是五個城市，八個感染者聚集區，十七次越獄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "走過這麼多城市，卡拉頓城算得上是相當有趣的一個地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "所有人都是一樣，天亮了就去賺錢，天黑了就去喝酒。眼睛閉上的時候就絕不會為第二天的事擔憂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "感染者，普通人，又有什麼區別呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "說不定哪一天，“轟隆”一聲，整個卡拉頓港區全部掉進海裡，就全都結束啦~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "所以，如果要挑一個葬身之地的話，這倒是個不錯的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "在一個可以俯視整個卡拉頓城的地方，全身變成一整塊石頭，然後，“嘭”的一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "什麼都不留下，誰也不知道——但還是要找個遠些的地方，免得粉塵隨風飄過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "身體裡的那些石頭似乎平靜下來了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "看來還不是時候，至少不是今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "在那一天來臨之前，還是要先考慮一下明天該上哪玩才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "呀，不知不覺，天都已經亮了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "早安，維多利亞，早上好，卡拉頓城。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "那麼今天，哪戶幸運人家會受到貓貓的眷顧呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1097年11月23日 10:14 P.M."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這邊的建築物，一直沒有人住啊......是因為靠近廢棄城區嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "舊倉庫......嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "說不定有什麼能用的東西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "進去看看吧~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "食物......這種地方也不會有食物吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "會有什麼值錢的東西嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "好多灰塵，難聞的機油味，也沒有什麼可愛的東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這個花瓶倒是挺漂亮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別亂動那些東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（？！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我就不明白了，不就是綁架幾個感染者和一個老頭子嗎，至於這麼興師動眾的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閉嘴，拿錢辦事，多的別問。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（呼......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......武器清點好了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒問題，對付那個糟老頭子議員可太綽綽有餘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（武器？議員？無聊的東西......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還是不能大意，我可不太相信那幾個雇來的打手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爆炸物呢？那些源石炸彈我們不用管了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "爆炸物的事情有其他人操心，我們倆就不管了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我們準備好武器和施術單元就行，三個小時以後會有人來推進工作的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "然後咱們在沸區等他們事成來接頭就行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼人？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "聽到了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "怪了......我明明鎖好門了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我聽得很清楚，有人進來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "人，哪有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "這麼小的房間哪藏得下一個人，大概是隻貓吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "說得對，的確有隻不知死活的貓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "讓我看看，是哪隻小貓咪闖進了她不該來的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "喂喂，能不能不要這麼小氣，讓路過的流浪貓借宿一下也不行？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "感染者？你可真會挑時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "都說了，我只是路過的流浪貓喔。不小心才跑到這裡的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "如果賠給你們一個花瓶的話，二位能不能當作無事發生呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......我沒興趣問你聽到了什麼，也不管你是不是真的只是誤打誤撞才來到這。既然被我們發現了，就別想活著離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "去死吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你們難道沒有聽過一句話，“不能傷害貓，好運會跑掉”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "沒射中？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "還有能力反擊......這黑霧到底是什麼東西——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "呵呵，別這麼著急嘛。不如再給你們猜一個謎語好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "“為什麼石頭像煙火？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "別想逃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "逃到這，總可以避一會兒了吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "呃......貴族的房間，總是有種讓人想吐的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "肩膀......那個凶巴巴的傢伙，射得還挺準的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "還好，應該沒傷到骨頭......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（握住箭杆）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "請問......這位小姐？您是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "不許動！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "噓！別出聲！我不想殺你，只是借你這躲一會兒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你最好配合一點，要是不老實，我就把這支箭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "冷靜一點，小姐，不要緊張。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "您......您看起來受傷了，您需要幫助嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "源石技藝產生的黑煙彌漫在屋內，老人向後退了一步，卻跌倒在地上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老爺？有事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（緊張）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我在寫議案，天亮之前不要來打擾我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "好的老爺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "這位，女士......咳......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒猜錯的話，您應該是感染者對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要緊張......我不會傷害您......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "年邁的貴族",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年邁的薩弗拉貴族突然捂住了心臟，發出了痛苦的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "......你怎麼了？我只是用源石技藝嚇唬你一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "唉......這下麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "來人啊！有人倒下了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（唉，該走了......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎麼了老爺？剛才那個女孩子的聲音......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "僕人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "昂斯特老爺！你怎麼了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "現在怎麼辦？我們為什麼不衝進去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你傻啊？你也不看看這屋子是什麼人住的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "這是那個昂斯特議員的宅子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "議員？那些貴族老爺的家？在這種地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "怎麼還有議員的宅子修在靠近感染者社區的地方？而且這也太小了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "好了你閉嘴吧。咱們得想想別的辦法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "她在那邊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "跑出來了？那還省事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你們兩個......好煩啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "別想跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "追！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "她中了一箭，應該跑不遠才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "但要小心她的源石技藝。不確定有沒有殺傷力，但是能迷惑感知。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "她到底有什麼本事——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "又平地起霧了？是她在施術！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "她躲進去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "“綠意火花”......這是酒吧？看著不太像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "這邊的房屋構造應該都是一樣的，這些老房子除了正門沒有別的出口，她逃不了了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "慢著，先別急。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "那個菲林的源石技藝很厲害，小心那股黑煙。想抓她太難了，要打到也不容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "我們沒那麼多時間陪她耗著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "那些燃燒彈你還帶著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "你要把這兒燒了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "這地方房屋這麼密集，你確定？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "不用猶豫，感染者的死活沒人在乎。就算事情鬧大了，對我們也是障眼的好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "別管那麼多了，動作快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "這事情不能有任何差錯，不能留活口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "......明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "咳......咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "差不多了，撤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "*粗口*，就為這個礦石病垃圾，費老子一晚上的工夫......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魁梧的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "聽說感染者死後會化成灰炸開？我還從來沒有親眼見過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鬼祟的黑衣人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "text": "別多事，快走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "想要抓住貓貓......得再聰明一點......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "聽好了......才不是被你們逼入絕境的......這是我自己......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1097年11月26日 9:27 A.M.\n刺痛。\n肺在痛，胃在痛，肝也在痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "普通的止痛藥......已經沒用了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "病痛纏身的菲林女孩透過廢舊房屋的窗戶看向天空。\n濃霧籠罩了卡拉頓城，甚至看不到太陽的光亮。\n從灰山地到多倫郡，從開夏郡再到卡拉頓。\n一路逃跑，一路漂泊，同伴一個接著一個逝去。\n走得越遠，失去的越多。\n浮萍總有沉落之池。\n貓貓，已經累了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "女巫姐姐，你還好嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "咳......咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "女巫姐姐，那是血嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "果然......已經到極限了啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "小敏，我給你一些東西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "認得這些硬幣的面值嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "認得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "每天拿一個，可以去威綸奶奶那邊換點吃的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "還有這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "菲林女巫掏出一個黑色的帆布寬簷帽子和一枚精緻的戒指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "（唉，女巫的儀式......現在也沒什麼意義了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "我是巫女林的第一百一十三位女巫，夜煙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "灰山地的先賢見證一切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "見證一位新人的加入......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "見證一個新的靈魂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "還記得你之前問我的那件事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你現在已經是個女巫了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "真的嗎？我也可以使用源石技藝了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "認真聽我說，你本來就可以使用源石技藝，你很有天分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "但是以後使用源石技藝，要好好用這個戒指，像我之前教你的那樣，沒有這個戒指，就不准使用源石技藝，明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "還有，只允許對壞人使用源石技藝哦，還記得怎麼區分壞人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "記得！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "那就好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "菲林女巫站了起來，晃晃悠悠地向門口走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "感染者少女",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_045_nn_1",
      "text": "女巫姐姐？你要走了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "是啊......我該走了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "1097年11月27日 3:47 A.M.\n卡拉頓城的邊緣廢棄城區，這個城市最安靜的區域。\n數年前自然災害席捲了卡拉頓城之後，這片年久失修的地塊被遷移到了城市的邊緣。\n搖搖欲墜的樓房與徹底損壞的地面結構，見證了卡拉頓的歷史。\n站在廢區的高樓上，遠處是一望無際的荒地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "如果要挑一個葬身之地的話，這倒是個有趣的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "早就料到了會有這一天，也不能說是“沒想到會來得這麼快”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "菲林女巫靠坐在牆角，閉上了眼睛。\n礦石病病灶的刺痛感已經逐漸淡去，身體也越來越沉重。\n回憶如同走馬燈一樣，浮現在她的腦海。\n曾經的女巫同伴們，那位慈祥的大女巫格蘭特，維多利亞軍人的火炮點燃巫女林的那個夜晚。\n在荒地與城市間漂泊，不得已以盜竊為生的日子，那些不公的迫害。\n已經不再重要了。\n一切就要結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然而她的耳邊，卻傳來了陣陣啜泣聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "怎麼到最後關頭，還有人打攪......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這種地方還有人啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "追隨著傳到耳邊的聲音，夜煙來到了廢樓的另一個區域。\n在她的眼前，有一個菲林女孩正顫顫巍巍地站在廢棄高樓的窗邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（啜泣）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對不起......對不起，媽媽......對不起......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我已經......不知道該怎麼辦了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "帶著無助與絕望的表情，菲林女孩在廢棄建築的邊緣搖搖欲墜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你這樣很危險哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "哎呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "你......你是誰......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "我是誰不重要哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "不過在你要跳下去之前，我得告訴你幾件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "跳下去的話，真的會摔得很難看哦，我實在是不推薦你做這種事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "等明天你的朋友看到你的時候，他們會很痛苦吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......朋友......夏櫟姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "啜泣的女孩猶豫著，離開了窗邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這就對啦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "我該怎麼稱呼你呢，小貓貓？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......蘇茜......蘇茜·格里特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這個名字挺好聽的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你叫我夜煙就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "夜煙......小姐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "夜煙小姐......這麼晚了，為什麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "我還要問你呢，這兒可是我專屬的秘密據點，你是怎麼發現的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "算啦，我也可以特別允許可愛的貓貓來這裡玩哦，但用來跳樓可不行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "嗚......嗚嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "欸欸，你哭什麼呀？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......不......我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "唉......算了，想哭就哭吧，沒人會聽到，所以也不用憋著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "反正這裡也沒人——雖然這兒也沒有酒，要是有酒就更好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "不過我正好還有點時間，來聊聊吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "為什麼要幹這種傻事呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我......有一個許多年的夢想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "一個許多年的夢想？那聽起來挺好啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我......我為這個夢想努力了許多年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我覺得，那就是我生命的全部意義了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "直到前幾天，一轉眼，什麼都沒有了......都被別人毀掉了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我甚至不知道為什麼......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "什麼都沒剩下......全都......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "感染者的生命又能有幾年......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "被別人毀掉了啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "所以你想到的第一件事情就是毀滅自己？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這不是很奇怪嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "啊......啊？你在說什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "是你自己說的呀。你的人生意義，你美好的夢想都被別人毀掉了，那你在做什麼呢？把最後剩下的一點東西也毀掉嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不......不是這樣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "把手伸過來，讓我看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "哎，哎——你要幹什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "沒有結晶......感染程度算不上重吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "我、我也不太清楚......\n哎呀，幹嘛敲我腦袋！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "對不聰明的小貓就應該敲敲腦袋讓她清醒過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "為了夢想活著......對於感染者來說真是奢侈的想法啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "那麼多人渾渾噩噩地活著，混吃等死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "“反正大家都活不久，目標和理想什麼的，何必要活得那麼累呢？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "但是你選擇了為一個夢想而活著，很了不起哦，像你這樣的人可太少見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "但是你看......你只要還活著，辦法總會有的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "你的時間比你想的要多得多，不像......我跑題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "如果就這麼放棄了，那就太遺憾啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......可是我又能做什麼呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "像你這麼可愛的貓貓，朋友一定很多吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "為什麼不去找你的朋友們聊一聊呢？一個人蹲在這裡瞎想可是一點好處都沒有哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "如果什麼東西丟了，就找回來，被別人搶走了，就想辦法搶回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "就這麼放棄了，可就什麼都沒有囉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "那些壞人會笑得更開心，這樣對自己也不公平吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "那些毀掉你夢想的壞傢伙，他們才應該被丟到樓下去，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "年輕的菲林猶豫地看向窗邊，她的臉上充斥著無奈。在這個破舊漆黑的廢樓中，時間緩慢地流逝著。\n在一陣沉默與思考後，她長歎了一口氣，露出了疲憊的笑容，似乎放下了一些精神上的重擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "......你說得對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "如果還有什麼難過的地方，那就大聲喊出來吧，反正這裡也沒什麼人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不......不用了......謝謝你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "這就對了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "以前大女巫說過，只要還能看到明天的太陽，一切就還都有希望。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_141_nights_1",
      "text": "至少......還有......明......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "欸，欸欸！夜煙小姐！你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "小心......別靠近我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "夜煙小姐！你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "夜煙",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "你......快走......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "怎麼回事，身上怎麼這麼燙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "振作一點！醒醒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "來人啊！救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "夜煙小姐......你堅持一下，我們，馬上就到城區了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "我......我要背不動你了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不，不是說夜煙小姐太重了，一點也不重，是我力氣太小了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "背上的女孩，氣息越來越弱。\n她能感覺到，一個鮮活的生命正在淡去。\n一種潮濕且溫暖的觸感從背上傳來，逐漸擴散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "這是什麼......這是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "這是......血？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "暗紅色的鮮血從少女的口鼻中滲出，滴落在地面上。\n她明白這代表著什麼，每個感染者都明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不要......不要......不要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "夜煙小姐......不要......求求你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "從五年前離開家鄉起，她已經不止一次目睹過感染者的離去。\n伴隨著每一次身邊熟知的人消逝，她對死亡的感知也更加麻木。\n每個感染者都要面對這樣的命運。\n但是這一次，不知道為什麼，她不願意承受目睹眼前生命消逝的痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "求求你！夜煙小姐......求求你......不要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "堅持住......我們就快到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "她讓背上的女孩平躺在地上，想要減少她的痛苦。\n她緊緊地握著眼前這位女孩的手，她嘗試去擦拭對方臉上的血跡。\n她徒勞地努力著，她嘗試阻止死亡的來臨。\n然而在迫近的死亡面前，這一切都顯得沒有意義。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "救命......救命啊！！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "不管是誰......求求你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "幫幫我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "蘇茜",
      "speakerId": "avg_377_gdglow_1",
      "text": "幫幫我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "低聲的哭喊穿過了空曠的夜空，回蕩在無人的廢棄街區。\n遠處，一陣緩慢的腳步聲傳來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_328_1",
      "text": "......蘇茜小姐？你怎麼在這裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
